{"id":"n18994-1-7","stage":4,"title":"감미롭다 · 甜美","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n18994-1-7-1","ko":"어떤 커피를 좋아하세요?","zh":"您喜欢哪种咖啡呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커피를","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하세요?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/aecef20cfab461f85667.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n18994-1-7-2","ko":"저는 쓴 커피보다는 부드럽고 감미로운 맛의 커피를 좋아해요.","zh":"比起苦味的咖啡，我更喜欢口感柔和、味道香甜的咖啡。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저는","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓴","meaning":"苦","explanation":"쓰다：苦；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16488","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커피보다는","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부드럽고","meaning":"柔嫩，嫩","explanation":"부드럽다：柔嫩，嫩；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"부드럽다","audio":"/audio/5bca329372c891599d09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59372","senseId":"2","lemma":"부드럽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"감미로운","meaning":"甜美，甘美，香甜","explanation":"감미롭다：甜美，甘美，香甜；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"감미롭다","audio":"/audio/213be1dd79113298a093.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18994","senseId":"1","lemma":"감미롭다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛의","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커피를","meaning":"咖啡","explanation":"커피：咖啡；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"커피","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27372","senseId":"2","lemma":"커피","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아해요.","meaning":"爱吃，爱喝","explanation":"좋아하다：爱吃，爱喝；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"3","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"苦","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"16488","definition":"像药的滋味一样。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"a4215a3126661d52","term":"커피","zh":"咖啡","audio":"/audio/a4215a3126661d523ba2.mp3","entryId":"27372","definition":"是一种用咖啡豆制作出来的、苦涩的深棕色饮品，其含有独特的香味及咖啡因。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5bca329372c89159","term":"부드럽다","zh":"柔嫩，嫩","audio":"/audio/5bca329372c891599d09.mp3","entryId":"59372","definition":"在口中咀嚼时食物的感觉不硬或筋斗。","pronunciation":["부드럽따"]},{"id":"213be1dd79113298","term":"감미롭다","zh":"甜美，甘美，香甜","audio":"/audio/213be1dd79113298a093.mp3","entryId":"18994","definition":"味道甜。","pronunciation":["감미롭따"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"爱吃，爱喝","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"特别喜欢吃或喝特定的食物。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/94ee16930a3f8d91955a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.705,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=18994","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":132,"sequenceScore":2.5317,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["比起苦味的咖啡，我更喜欢口感柔和、味道香甜的咖啡。","您喜欢哪种咖啡呢？","养这些马的人会在这里吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您喜欢哪种咖啡呢？","养这些马的人会在这里吗？","比起苦味的咖啡，我更喜欢口感柔和、味道香甜的咖啡。"],"answer":2}]}
